----------------------------------------------------------------------

This product depends on MMEditing / MMagic (RealBasicVSR implementation),
which is available under the Apache License 2.0.
The source code can be found at https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmagic.

This product uses the SPyNet optical-flow weights (spynet_20210409-c6c1bd09.pth)
as redistributed by OpenMMLab. The SPyNet weights are free for non-commercial
and scientific research purposes only; for commercial use contact
ps-license@tue.mpg.de. See https://github.com/anuragranj/spynet.

This product depends on SeedVR2 (ByteDance-Seed), whose code and model
weights are available under the Apache License 2.0.
The source code can be found at https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR.
The vendored inference implementation is ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler,
also available under the Apache License 2.0.
The source code can be found at https://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler.

This product depends on SwiftVR (H-oliday), whose code and model weights are
available under the Apache License 2.0. SwiftVR is built on Wan2.2-TI2V-5B
(Wan-AI), also available under the Apache License 2.0.
The source code can be found at https://github.com/H-oliday/SwiftVR and the
weights at https://huggingface.co/H-oliday/SwiftVR.
MODIFICATION NOTICE: the bundled file
engine-python/weights/SwiftVR/swiftvr_transformer_fp8.safetensors is a modified
form of the official transformer weights: Linear weights are stored as
float8_e4m3fn with per-output-channel scales (weight-only quantization), and the
attention Q/K/V projections are pre-fused. The conversion code is
engine-python/vsr_models/swiftvr_runner.py (convert_official_to_fp8). The
vendored inference code in engine-python/vendor/swiftvr is unmodified
(upstream commit recorded in engine-python/vendor/swiftvr/UPSTREAM.txt).
SwiftVR runs with diffusers 0.36 (Hugging Face, Apache License 2.0) and decord
(DMLC, Apache License 2.0), installed in engine-python/swiftvr-libs.
